    a [38;5;153m<legend>[39m heading. Using fieldsets also means screen readers announce which group a field is in.
  - [1m[38;5;153mpublic/settings.css[39m:[0m the page itself no longer has a white background. Instead, each card is its own white, rounded
    panel on the grey background, with more space between cards. The group headings are styled so they sit inside the
    cards.
